        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4f9ce7a6cc824aa893f91c63d5f181dd",
      "statement": "The SPI master at 0xF0080 has control, status, data and divider registers, mode-0 timing with SCK = clock / (2*(DIV+1)), a reset divider of 0 giving 3.375 MHz at 6.75 MHz, and a software-selected divider of 8 for about 375 kHz SD initialisation.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://rtl/deep16_spi.sv#L1-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:817bb1b29a101be946dfb27892626ffc3750bcb4d702abd3132f9736005da5d6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b5f2fd9ea2354c2e9ec216f0344b5301",
      "statement": "The I2S block at 0xF00A0 has a sample register, a control register and a status register, with BCLK = clock / 10 = 675 kHz, LRCLK = BCLK / 32 = 21.09 kHz at 6.75 MHz, a 128-sample FIFO and a low-level interrupt threshold of 32.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://rtl/deep16_i2s.sv#L1-L10",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e731fd27c8d5129f0413b4c2951fbc461b2ab7fc914dd8d430cfe393789e4b73:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://rtl/deep16_i2s.sv#L55-L62",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d41d552bf4c44b2b9e41330759f97703927569f729a3e959986df1abf6e8b3d5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9152d2a8521b44d99782f39a937e8c53",
      "statement": "The SIC at 0xF00B0 provides pending, enable, status, scratch and raster registers, with the pending register cleared by writing ones, and asserts irq as pending AND enable with no priority encoder.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://rtl/deep16_sic.sv#L1-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:37379a28347631753fb46fbd56df5ece635aa6f10ae26fd1d4d5550b67389f20:"
