      "id": "claim_61106e2a6a1640fdac67603be47f0beb",
      "statement": "core3 takes a hardware interrupt target from the vector word at physical address 1, distinct from the SWI vector at physical address 2, and an IRQ is taken before the parked instruction runs.",
