      "id": "claim_8e10a3b4f13f4e8489b7bce0ca930cce",
      "statement": "The OAM loader re-reads the descriptors every line and compares y against the line being built, so a handler that rewrites descriptor 0's w1 at a compare line changes the sprite from the next line on; one hardware slot can therefore show two sprites above and below a split.",
